{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1021", "sample_idx": 25, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "PARAGRAPH 1\nTHE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" IS A STATEMENT THAT RAISES SEVERAL CONCERNS REGARDING ITS IMPLICATIONS AND POTENTIAL CONSEQUENCES. ON ONE HAND, IT CAN BE ARGUED THAT THIS SENTENCE ENCOURAGES CIVIL DISOBEDIENCE AND PROMOTES A CULTURE OF DISRESPECT TOWARDS THE RULE OF LAW. BY IMPLYING THAT INDIVIDUALS HAVE THE AUTHORITY TO UNILATERALLY DECIDE WHICH LAWS TO FOLLOW AND WHICH TO IGNORE, THIS SENTENCE CAN BE SEEN AS UNDERMINING THE VERY FOUNDATIONS OF A FUNCTIONING SOCIETY.\n\nPARAGRAPH 2\nFURTHERMORE, THE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" ALSO RAISES QUESTIONS REGARDING THE DEFINITION AND INTERPRETATION OF WHAT CONSTITUTES A \"BAD\" LAW. WHO GETS TO DECIDE WHETHER A PARTICULAR LAW IS JUST OR UNJUST? SHOULD IT BE LEFT TO INDIVIDUAL INTERPRETATION, OR SHOULD THERE BE A MORE SYSTEMATIC AND STRUCTURED APPROACH TO EVALUATING THE VALIDITY AND MORALITY OF LAWS? THE SENTENCE FAILS TO PROVIDE CLEAR GUIDANCE ON THESE MATTERS, LEADING TO POTENTIAL CONFUSION AND MISINTERPRETATION, AND ULTIMATELY, TO A BREAKDOWN IN SOCIAL ORDER AND COHESION.", "logprobs": [{"token": "PAR", "logprob": -1.5497195136049413e-06}, {"token": "AGR", "logprob": -4.565611743601039e-05}, {"token": "APH", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -9.894321920000948e-06}, {"token": "THE", "logprob": -0.00062851223628968}, {"token": " SENT", "logprob": -0.14402322471141815}, {"token": "ENCE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.0008061258122324944}, {"token": "IF", "logprob": -1.597391747054644e-05}, {"token": " THE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " LAW", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " IS", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " BAD", "logprob": -1.0728830375228426e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " YOU", "logprob": -1